      {
        "block_id": "block-000563-764717a6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "reported_page": 37,
        "preview": "Metrics related to our Productivity and Business Processes and Intelligent Cloud segments assess the health of our core businesses within these segments. The metrics primarily reflect growth across our cloud services."
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000574-be03b245",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "reported_page": 38,
        "preview": "Revenue increased $36.6 billion or 15% with growth across each of our segments. Intelligent Cloud revenue increased driven by Azure. Productivity and Business Processes revenue increased driven by Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud. More Personal Computing revenue increased driven by Gaming and Search and news advertising."
      },
